# Tourmaline Project Recipe v1
#
# The Animated Knight demo pak set (the demo-content GitHub release
# asset set: knight.tapp + knight-<hash>.pak). The Intel "Animated
# Knight" (GPU Research Samples Library, CC BY 4.0 — see
# KNIGHT-CREDITS.md) is a skinned, animated character: ONE skin
# (85 joints) + a walk clip. It cooks SKINNED (no setStatic) with
# LODs OFF (single-level chain — the GPU task/mesh raster
# eligibility shape) and meshlets ON (the import default) so the
# scene draws through the skinned task/mesh path. The scene authors
# no GI volumes and no cubemap captures, so the recipe-level bakes
# stay OFF.

recipe 1
project Knight
entry content/scenes/knight.tour

import lods off

bake gi off
bake cubemaps off

[pak knight]
output knight.pak
scene content/scenes/knight.tour
